    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: -5
  Sappy_Question:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: I did! Before me and your grandfather moved in together shortly after
        uni, I shared a flat with some roommates for some odd years.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
      AnimatedReaction: {fileID: 0}
      AudioResponse: 
      HasAdvancedSignal: 0
      AdvancedSignal: 0
    - Dialogue: Those were the times...
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
      AnimatedReaction: {fileID: 0}
      AudioResponse: 
      HasAdvancedSignal: 0
      AdvancedSignal: 0
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: Did you move out when you were my age?
